note seed/ng/src/ir.om: ΩIR in memory (seed/ng/IR.md s14), its builder, and the one binary reader
note and writer of the ng compiler. Owner: ng-ir lane. First unit of seed/ng/ng.units; no fn main.
note Names: functions ir_*, globals i_* (D1b). Other lanes read the i_* tables and call ir_*; they
note never write a table directly. Handles are uint, 0 = none, numbered from 1 in creation order.
note
note Row table: one line per op, "OP NAME TK IMM FIX VAR TY" (IR.md s7.12). TK 0 P, 1 E, 2 R, 3 T.
note TY 0 always 0, 1 result type, 2 optional result, 3 parameter (no result value).
